OL,3,GNEWSAYour guide on where to take the
OL,4,Akids this Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith just over a month to go, the
OL,7,Fcountdown to Christmas is on, and many
OL,8,Fof us will soon be planning our festive
OL,9,Fdays out.
OL,11,FAcross the West Midlands, there is a
OL,12,Frange of markets, theatre shows and
OL,13,Flight-switch-on events that will help
OL,14,Fyou to get into the Christmas cheer.
OL,16,FHere is a look at some of the biggest
OL,17,Fevents happening across the region:
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
